      "internal/gateway/gemini_function_parts_test.go::TestGeminiFunctionResponseImageReachesUpstream"
    ],
    "adaptation": "Borrows only the native Gemini request/function-call shape from Magpie. The root cachedContent/safetySettings, ordered systemInstruction parts, multi-name ANY selection, and Relay fidelity expectations are independent RCC requirements for issue 8a508d3, not Magpie golden output."
  },
  "contract_differences": [
    {
      "source_behavior": "Magpie's same-protocol Gemini path is not the Relay consumer under test and does not carry these root/system/selection residuals.",
      "rcc_requirement": "A same-protocol Gemini Relay must preserve the full root cachedContent/safetySettings, the exact systemInstruction part boundaries, the complete declared tool set, and the complete current allowed-name selection on the first provider attempt."
    }
  ],
